{
  "feature": "Social R1 (friends and pods): /friends head (face, name, commander picker), friends list with remove, open friend links with the hold at ten, Add a friend, the pods table and its menu (PR E1, E2), and the friend request card at /friend/[token] (PR D); plan 2026-10-15-social-r1.md.",
  "clearAbout": true,
  "note": "Needs SOCIAL_FRIENDS_ENABLED=true. Rows carry a phase: each phase is one seeded state of the signed-in account, so run the sheet once per phase over that phase's rows. empty: no friends, no links, no commander. full: a commander, six friends (Dave befriended today, DAVE_PUBLIC_ID his public id), two open links, one under a day from expiry. held: as full, with ten open links. Seed only on a scratch branch. add-friend, making-link and pod-add-nofriends-invite each make a link, so they run last in their phase; making-link throttles the page for the rest of its run. solo: no friends, one solo pod (Draft night). pods: as full, plus Kim and Lee (not friends; Kim is Jo's friend), pods Thursday Commander (yours, five friends, spares shared), Draft night (yours, just you), Everyone (yours, all six), Game night at Jo's (Jo owns, you and Kim, spares off) and Cube club (handed on to you when Jo left; Kim not a friend), and landing tokens: SELF_TOKEN, OPEN_TOKEN_{PHONE,DESKTOP} (Kim), OPEN_NOFACE_TOKEN (Lee, no commander), FRIENDS_TOKEN_{PHONE,DESKTOP} (Dave), DECLINE_TOKEN_{PHONE,DESKTOP}, EXPIRED_TOKEN, REVOKED_TOKEN, ACCEPT_TOKEN_{PHONE,DESKTOP} (Lee). accept: run after pods without reseeding (Accept makes Lee a friend). The signed-out card and the account menu row are outside this script's reach (it always signs in, and its verbs are scoped to <main>), so they are photographed separately.",
